460d20819d155d5eb5b.poster.avif?t=1761647227\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/bb11d602daaa7460d20819d155d5eb5b.webm?t=1761647227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/bb11d602daaa7460d20819d155d5eb5b.mp4?t=1761647227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night you are tasked with fetching books for your fellow monks. Recall where you have stored them and retrieve them swiftly, because all orders must be completed by dawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make use of thy tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/499ff6c0f853af501c836a171167dae2.poster.avif?t=1761647227\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/499ff6c0f853af501c836a171167dae2.webm?t=1761647227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/499ff6c0f853af501c836a171167dae2.mp4?t=1761647227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the Abbot\u2019s blessings on a variety of tools to aid you. Ladders can be carried and placed to reach top shelves. Torches are vital to see at night, and can be placed on walls. Fires can be extinguished with water from the well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend thyself\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/7aaaf2a591c5789c45c55a8425713046.poster.avif?t=1761647227\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/7aaaf2a591c5789c45c55a8425713046.webm?t=1761647227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/7aaaf2a591c5789c45c55a8425713046.mp4?t=1761647227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monks speak of strange happenings at night. Some have seen fantastical creatures that seem to have lept from the very pages into reality. Arm yourself with the weapons you need to defend yourself, and the collection, after dark. If all else fails, you can always throw a book. They\u2019re heavy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/ddf49a7c6986ddc43c6b212e835efde8.poster.avif?t=1761647227\" width=800 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/ddf49a7c6986ddc43c6b212e835efde8.webm?t=1761647227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/extras/ddf49a7c6986ddc43c6b212e835efde8.mp4?t=1761647227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monk Took Book</i> is playable in single player, but can also be enjoyed with friends as you share tools, exorcise ghosts, and discuss where you left those books.</p>","developers":["SquarePlay Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/3d633de6b18256ee723e8107d82d4029713dda3b/header.jpg?t=1761647227","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022090/1289543264/79d918bdb5a40dfa006c9aba3887e3